message: "If you use ChAAt, please cite the software and the accompanying COLING 2027 demonstration paper."
title: "ChAAt: A Chinese-specific Ability Atlas for Probing Linguistic Diversity in Large Language Models"
abstract: "An auditable diagnostic system that links Chinese-internal language capability gaps in LLMs to source-verified items, model outputs, explanations, and item-level statistics."
